<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Motors to announce loss for US sales unit.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Motors to announce loss for US sales unit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp said it would announce an appraisal loss for its U.S. sales subsidiary at 3 p.m. (0600 GMT) on Friday.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
